<title>UK: C&amp;W gets shareholder OK to end Veba alliance.</title>
<headline>C&amp;W gets shareholder OK to end Veba alliance.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Cable and Wireless Plc said on Monday its shareholders had approved the previously-announced dissolution of its partnership with VEBA AG in Germany and the rest of continental Europe.</p>
<p>Under the terms of the deal, VEBA will buy C&amp;W's 45 percent stake in Vebacom GmbH for 2.21 billion marks, and C&amp;W will acquire full ownership of C&amp;W Europe SA by buying VEBA's 50 percent shareholding for 90 million marks, C&amp;W said in a statement.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to be completed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
